  "retrospective": "Bounded native providers separated recorded-date controls from device tests. The typed field and existing save validation remain authoritative; transient picker candidates permit incomplete entry without erasing the draft. Exact case identities deduplicate focused and remaining partitions.",
  "limitations": [
    "Native day/month and bounded year pickers supplement the existing typed date field. No automatic today or fabricated date components. Valid picker changes update the editor draft; explicit Save uses the existing edit flow and can change the recorded event.",
    "Precision mode changes, cancellation and incomplete picker input preserve the existing recorded date. Explicit clear removes only the date; a retained clock receives partial-date guidance. No API, schema, save-format or extraction change.",
